@startuml

title ECPay - RedirectToLogisticsSelection

class RedirectToLogisticsSelectionRequest {
    + MerchantID : string
    + TempLogisticsID : string ' 新建填 "0"
    + GoodsAmount : int        ' 1 ~ 20000
    + GoodsName : string
    + SenderName : string
    + SenderZipCode : string
    + SenderAddress : string
    + ServerReplyURL : string  ' 貨態通知端點
    + ClientReplyURL : string  ' 選店完成端點
}

class ClientReplyResponse {
    + TempLogisticsID : string
    + LogisticsType : string       ' CVS / HOME
    + LogisticsSubType : string    ' UNIMART / FAMI / HILIFE / TCAT / POST
    + ReceiverName : string
    + ReceiverCellPhone : string
    ' 超商才有值
    + ReceiverStoreID : string?
    + ReceiverStoreName : string?
    ' 宅配才有值
    + ReceiverZipCode : string?
    + ReceiverAddress : string?
    + RtnCode : int    ' 1 = 成功
    + RtnMsg : string
}

note top of RedirectToLogisticsSelectionRequest
    POST /Express/v2/RedirectToLogisticsSelection
    回傳 HTML (auto-submit form)
    前端渲染後自動跳轉到綠界選店頁面
end note

note top of ClientReplyResponse
    User 選完門市後
    綠界 POST 到 ClientReplyURL
    需立刻用 TempLogisticsID 呼叫 CreateByTempTrade
end note

@enduml
